        "notes": "The site is equipped with permanent power supply. 1.2 ha are divided into 4 irrigated (irrigated) and 4 non-irrigated (ambient) plots. Irrigation (additional 700 mm per year) has been provided since 2003. In 2013, 1/3 of the area of each irrigated plot, the irrigation has been stopped (irrigation-stop). 6 scaffolds (2 per treatment; ambient, irrigated, irrigation-stop) are providing access into the crown of approx. 3-6 trees per scaffold. Two containers provide shelter for instruments, computers and storage. ",
